# 5. DASHBOARD ANALYTICS

All production dashboard metrics must be derived from persisted case records.

Do not use the architectural image's sample numbers as real statistics.

## 5.1 Required KPI Calculations

Total Requests:

Count of cases within the selected reporting scope.

New Requests:

Count of cases with status New.

Pending Requests:

Count of cases with status Pending.

Follow Up Requests:

Count of cases with status Follow Up.

Completed Requests:

Count of cases with status Completed.

Completion Rate:

Completed Requests / Total Requests × 100

Handle division by zero.

Overdue:

Count of incomplete cases whose applicable deadline has passed.

Due Soon:

Count of incomplete cases approaching their applicable deadline.

The current source code uses a 48-hour due-soon window. Preserve this behavior unless a different business rule is approved.

